        "text": "Mm-hmm .",
        "participant": "FIE073",
        "role": "ID"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.C.dialog-act.s9553330.35",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "Mm-hmm .",
        "participant": "FIE073",
        "role": "ID"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.61",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "so you've you've had to meet with the marketing team and how they're going to market and what are the marketing strategic plan , okay ,",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.62",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "when are you going to introduce , okay , and by the time you introduce the product and uh you know there there would be a competition ,",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.63",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "okay , so I need some kind of uh uh the plan in the writing from you .",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.C.dialog-act.s9553330.36",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "<vocalsound> And when would you like that ?",
        "participant": "FIE073",
        "role": "ID"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.64",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "Okay , and it's po",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.65",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "B as soon as possible .",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.C.dialog-act.s9553330.37",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "<vocalsound> Uh well if uh if we have enough time uh then d do you think um two weeks is a <disfmarker> is close enough ?",
        "participant": "FIE073",
        "role": "ID"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.66",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "Yes I think uh that would be good ,",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.59",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM",
        "text": "Yeah , but uh I need something in the writing ,"
